# Comment Style Playbook

When writing comments:

- Explain responsibility, intent, constraints, side effects, and state changes.
- Avoid comments that only repeat obvious code.
- Prioritize public APIs, shared modules, async flows, and complex business rules.

## Cross-Project Standards

新项目启动、设计系统制定或跨页面规范统一时，先读取 `project-standards-playbook/SKILL.md` 及其适用细则；小修复按影响范围应用，保留已有确认参数。
